# The local CI: the full check set before anything leaves the machine.
# The same definition is compiled into the GitHub workflow
# (sverka.config.ts), so the local gate and CI check the same things.
#
# The CLI is run through npx on purpose: the published `sverka` package
# depends on `@sverka/hub`, which is not on the registry, so `npm ci` cannot
# install it. npx tolerates the missing package and the CLI works.
npx --yes sverka@0.2.33 run --entry ci/local
